  "description": "Emilia is reborn in a romance game as the jealous friend of Ophelia Windrose. Knowing that Ophelia will die young, Emilia chooses to love her, and the two grow as close as sisters. After her friend's death, Emilia departs to live a quiet life. The three male love interests are supposed to use the loss to connect to Ophelia's replacement. But instead of pursuing her, they all seem more interested in Emilia! Can Emilia navigate their newfound desire, or will she always be in Ophelia's shadow? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
